    "detailed_description": "<i>\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of the Grand Jury Prize for Best VR Work at the 78th Venice International <br>Film Festival (2021)<br>\ud83c\udf9e Nominated for an Emmy Award in the Outstanding Interactive Media Innovation <br>category (2022) </i><br><br><strong>ABOUT GOLIATH</strong><br><br>Through mind-bending animation, <i>GOLIATH: PLAYING WITH REALITY</i> explores the <br>limits of reality and a true story of so-called \u2018schizophrenia\u2019 and the power of gaming <br>communities. <br><br>Echo (Tilda Swinton) guides you through the many realities of Goliath, a man who spent <br>years isolated in psychiatric institutions but finds connection in multiplayer games. <br>Combining heartfelt dialogue, mesmerising visuals and symbolic interactions, weave <br>through multiple worlds to uncover Goliath\u2019s poignant story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Follow Goliath himself on his Twitch channel<br>Follow our Instagam for updates #goliathvr",
    "about_the_game": "<i>\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of the Grand Jury Prize for Best VR Work at the 78th Venice International <br>Film Festival (2021)<br>\ud83c\udf9e Nominated for an Emmy Award in the Outstanding Interactive Media Innovation <br>category (2022) </i><br><br><strong>ABOUT GOLIATH</strong><br><br>Through mind-bending animation, <i>GOLIATH: PLAYING WITH REALITY</i> explores the <br>limits of reality and a true story of so-called \u2018schizophrenia\u2019 and the power of gaming <br>communities. <br><br>Echo (Tilda Swinton) guides you through the many realities of Goliath, a man who spent <br>years isolated in psychiatric institutions but finds connection in multiplayer games. <br>Combining heartfelt dialogue, mesmerising visuals and symbolic interactions, weave <br>through multiple worlds to uncover Goliath\u2019s poignant story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/491f4ed2b65ecbfd2ba93fc3b342405b.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/ed614e8ed68c7ef6136f5a1e2d9464ca.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.poster.avif?t=1710869782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.webm?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138380/extras/f7234d363673704e730848c7f5375f08.mp4?t=1710869782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Follow Goliath himself on his Twitch channel<br>Follow our Instagam for updates #goliathvr",
    "short_description": "Narrated by Tilda Swinton, winner of Best VR Work at the 78th Venice International Film Festival and Emmy\u00ae-nominated GOLIATH: PLAYING WITH REALITY is a 25-minute animated VR experience about a man who spent years isolated in psychiatric institutions but finds connection in multiplayer games.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cFor anybody inclined to question the powerfully boundary-less capacities of VR to inspire and encourage empathy, inclusion, fellowship and transformation, GOLIATH might well be the original game changer. Beautiful, profoundly engaging and eventually resonantly simple, this work pushes the parameters of our understanding of the potential for the impact of gaming to provide a life-saving web of connection, support and joy for those who may be otherwise isolated and challenged by society. We emerge from its immersion into a reality with a kinder light and a brighter horizon.\u201d<br>Tilda Swinton<br><br>\u201cBy turns gripping, sad, and poignant, it\u2019s one of the great moving image attempts to understand mental illness from the inside out.\u201d<br>IndieWire<br><br>\u201cAt a time when virtual reality fuels the fantasy of a metaverse that allows us to free ourselves from certain limitations of the physical world, Goliath uses this technology for the opposite purpose: to make us experience the struggle and suffering of many men and women in the grip of great psychological difficulties, very real and too often forgotten. (Translated from French)\u201d<br>Le Monde<br>",
